  <text>
    <body>
      <div xml:lang="en">
        <head>English sample / 英語サンプル</head>
        <pb n="1" facs="#f1"/>
        <ab facs="#z1" n="1">In the spring of 1885, Captain <persName xml:id="JW-1a" corresp="#JW" next="#JW-1b">Jonathan</persName></ab>
        <ab facs="#z2" n="2"><persName xml:id="JW-1b" corresp="#JW" prev="#JW-1a">Whitfield</persName> departed from the port of</ab>
        <ab facs="#z3" n="3"><placeName corresp="#PSM">Portsmouth</placeName>, bound for the colony of <placeName xml:id="NC-1a" corresp="#NC" next="#NC-1b">New</placeName></ab>
        <ab facs="#z4" n="4"><placeName xml:id="NC-1b" corresp="#NC" prev="#NC-1a">Caledonia</placeName>. He was accompanied by <persName xml:id="LMA-1a" corresp="#LMA" next="#LMA-1b">Lady</persName></ab>
        <ab facs="#z5" n="5"><persName xml:id="LMA-1b" corresp="#LMA" prev="#LMA-1a">Margaret Ashford</persName> and her tutor, <persName xml:id="HP-1a" corresp="#HP" next="#HP-1b">Mr.</persName></ab>
        <ab facs="#z6" n="6"><persName xml:id="HP-1b" corresp="#HP" prev="#HP-1a">Henry Pembridge</persName>. They had spent the</ab>
        <ab facs="#z7" n="7">winter at the seaside town of <placeName xml:id="SH-1a" corresp="#SH" next="#SH-1b">Saint</placeName></ab>
        <ab facs="#z8" n="8"><placeName xml:id="SH-1b" corresp="#SH" prev="#SH-1a">Helier</placeName> on the island of <placeName corresp="#JE">Jersey</placeName>.</ab>
      </div>
      <div xml:lang="ja">
        <head>日本語サンプル / Japanese sample</head>
        <pb n="2" facs="#f2"/>
        <ab facs="#z9"  n="9">明治十八年の春、船長の<persName xml:id="TT-1a" corresp="#TT" next="#TT-1b">田中</persName></ab>
        <ab facs="#z10" n="10"><persName xml:id="TT-1b" corresp="#TT" prev="#TT-1a">太郎</persName>は<placeName corresp="#YOK">横浜</placeName>の港から汽船で</ab>
        <ab facs="#z11" n="11">出帆し、<placeName corresp="#HAK">函館</placeName>を経て<placeName xml:id="HOK-1a" corresp="#HOK" next="#HOK-1b">北海</placeName></ab>
        <ab facs="#z12" n="12"><placeName xml:id="HOK-1b" corresp="#HOK" prev="#HOK-1a">道</placeName>の<placeName corresp="#KSR">釧路</placeName>へと向かった。同行者は</ab>
        <ab facs="#z13" n="13">令嬢の<persName xml:id="YH-1a" corresp="#YH" next="#YH-1b">山田</persName></ab>
        <ab facs="#z14" n="14"><persName xml:id="YH-1b" corresp="#YH" prev="#YH-1a">花子</persName>と、その家庭教師の<persName xml:id="SR-1a" corresp="#SR" next="#SR-1b">佐</persName></ab>
        <ab facs="#z15" n="15"><persName xml:id="SR-1b" corresp="#SR" prev="#SR-1a">藤良介</persName>であった。一行は前年の</ab>
        <ab facs="#z16" n="16">冬を<placeName corresp="#IZU">伊豆</placeName>の<placeName corresp="#AJI">網代</placeName>で過ごしていた。</ab>
      </div>
      <div xml:lang="en" type="milestone-variant">
        <head>Milestone-based variant / milestone 構造での同例（分割不要）</head>
        <pb n="3" facs="#f3"/>
        <p>
          <lb facs="#z17" n="1"/>While travelling east toward
          <lb facs="#z18" n="2"/><placeName corresp="#CST">Constanti<pb n="4" facs="#f4"/><lb facs="#z19" n="1"/>nople</placeName>, <persName corresp="#RA">Reginald
          <lb facs="#z20" n="2"/>Ainsworth</persName> fell gravely ill.
        </p>
      </div>
    </body>
  </text>
